model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "T's base for M0's load-code fixtures (invented): scen's model with a place, read by its ask, and a scenario over it, scen.tally, whose row is a written figure; it loads clean"

source card "T's fixture card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

input amt: money PLN

def doubled: money PLN = amt + amt at reader

ask q: doubled, bal(konto, 2026-12-31) law 2026-03-01

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "the card"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
